  Slug: first-doctrine-warpriest
  DisplayName: First Doctrine (Warpriest)
  IconPath: icons/equipment/chest/breastplate-helmet-metal.webp
  Description: You're trained in light and medium armor, and you have expert proficiency
    in Fortitude saves. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Shield
    Block] general feat, a reaction to reduce damage with a shield. If your deity's
    favored weapon is a simple weapon or an unarmed attack, you gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Deadly
    Simplicity] cleric feat. At 13th level, if you gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Divine
    Defense] class feature, you also gain expert proficiency in light and medium
    armor.
